{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":44987,"ns":0,"title":"Borel–Cantelli lemma","extract":"The Borel–Cantelli lemma is a result in measure theory. It is often stated in the context of probability theory, where it is used to study whether, in a given sequence of events, a finite or infinite number of these events occur.","description":"Theorem in probability theory","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}